        "original_id": "3263e538-bc92-5ae3-ab46-4bd80349d2f8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Manganiello, Flash Thompson, Peter Parker, Spider-Man\n- Works: Spider-Man trilogy, ER, How I Met Your Mother, One Tree Hill, True Blood\n- Roles: Flash Thompson, Alcide Herveaux\n- Topics: Television roles, fictional character relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Manganiello played Flash Thompson in Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- Joe Manganiello had recurring television roles on ER, How I Met Your Mother, and One Tree Hill before his breakout role.\n- Joe Manganiello's breakout role was the werewolf Alcide Herveaux on the HBO series True Blood.\n- Flash Thompson is depicted as a star high school football player.\n- Flash Thompson mercilessly bullies his high school classmate Peter Parker.\n- Flash Thompson greatly admires Spider-Man, creating an irony because Spider-Man is Peter Parker.\n- Peter Parker and Flash Thompson become close friends in college.",
